@ 29.1.1.1.17 - Proto-Athabaskan to Sarcee
# citation: Whimemsz, from Krauss, Michael and Victor Golla (1981), “Northern Athapaskan
# 			Languages”. Handbook of North American Indians, Vol. 6 (Subarctic), 67 – 85
	{TŠ,TŠʷ} [+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo] Q > t͡s TŠ [+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo]
	ɑ́ ə́ ʊ́ > ɑ̄ ə̄ ʊ̄
	{e,ə} ʊ > ɑ u
	Vˀ > V:[+low tone]